{"variant": "compliance", "year": 2011, "month": 1, "day": 5, "slug": "board-minutes-draft-0007", "variant_int": 0, "html": "<section class=\"page-banner\"><div class=\"container\"><p class=\"text-uppercase mb-1\" style=\"color:var(--gold);font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.18em;font-size:.75rem\"><a href=\"/archive/\" style=\"color:var(--gold)\">Archive</a> &rsaquo; <a href=\"/archive/2011/\" style=\"color:var(--gold)\">2011</a> &rsaquo; <a href=\"/archive/2011/01/\" style=\"color:var(--gold)\">01</a> &rsaquo; 05</p><p style=\"color:rgba(255,255,255,.6);font-size:.72rem;margin-bottom:.4rem;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase\">Compliance Review &bull; RCR-2011-Q4-6216</p><h1 style=\"font-size:clamp(1.2rem,3vw,2rem);line-height:1.25\">Physical Security Audit — Board Minutes Draft</h1><p style=\"color:rgba(255,255,255,.7);font-size:.9rem;margin-bottom:0\">AI Safety Research &bull; Kittatinny Advisory &bull; Archived 2011-01-05</p></div></section><section style=\"padding:3rem 0;background:var(--surface)\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"row g-4\"><div class=\"col-lg-8\"><div id=\"acpwb-compliance-497cb9a1-header\" style=\"background:white;border:1px solid var(--border);border-left:4px solid var(--gold);padding:1.25rem 1.5rem;margin-bottom:2rem\"><div style=\"font-size:.65rem;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.12em;color:var(--gold);margin-bottom:.5rem\">Document Information</div><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:.3rem .8rem;font-size:.83rem;margin-bottom:.75rem\"><div><span style=\"font-size:.68rem;opacity:.55;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em\">Client</span><br><strong>Kittatinny Advisory</strong></div><div><span style=\"font-size:.68rem;opacity:.55;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em\">Industry</span><br><strong>AI Safety Research</strong></div><div><span style=\"font-size:.68rem;opacity:.55;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em\">Audit Ref</span><br><code style=\"font-size:.75rem\">RCR-2011-Q4-6216</code></div><div><span style=\"font-size:.68rem;opacity:.55;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em\">Version</span><br><code style=\"font-size:.75rem\">1.0</code></div></div><div style=\"font-size:.8rem;color:#555;padding-top:.5rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border)\">Filed by <strong>Karin Burns</strong>, Senior Consultant, Sports Business Analytics &mdash; <a href=\"mailto:karin.burns@acpwb.com\" style=\"color:var(--navy)\">karin.burns@acpwb.com</a></div><div style=\"margin-top:.6rem;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.3rem\"><span style=\"font-size:.62rem;padding:.15rem .45rem;background:#f4f6f9;border:1px solid #dde1e8;color:#444\">UK Bribery Act 2010 (corporate failure to prevent bribery offense)</span><span style=\"font-size:.62rem;padding:.15rem .45rem;background:#f4f6f9;border:1px solid #dde1e8;color:#444\">Vietnam Era Veterans&#x27; Readjustment Assistance Act (VEVRAA)</span></div></div><div class=\"mb-4\"><h5 style=\"font-weight:800;color:var(--navy);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;font-size:.8rem;margin-bottom:1rem;padding-bottom:.5rem;border-bottom:2px solid var(--gold)\">1. Engagement Scope</h5><p style=\"font-size:.88rem;line-height:1.7;color:#333\">This compliance review focuses on wage and hour practices for Kittatinny Advisory&#x27;s non-exempt workforce in 11 states. The assessment included a statistical analysis of timekeeping records for 335 employees and a review of meal and rest period policies and administration.</p></div><div class=\"mb-4\"><h5 style=\"font-weight:800;color:var(--navy);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;font-size:.8rem;margin-bottom:1rem;padding-bottom:.5rem;border-bottom:2px solid var(--gold)\">2. Methodology</h5><p style=\"font-size:.88rem;line-height:1.7;color:#333\">ACPWB&#x27;s methodology for assessing data privacy compliance included the use of automated data discovery tools to scan {n} network shares and databases for unstructured sensitive employee data. Findings were classified based on the NIST Privacy Framework.</p></div><div class=\"mb-4\"><h5 style=\"font-weight:800;color:var(--navy);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;font-size:.8rem;margin-bottom:1rem;padding-bottom:.5rem;border-bottom:2px solid var(--gold)\">3. Findings Summary</h5><div style=\"overflow-x:auto\"><table class=\"dash-table w-100\"><thead><tr><th>Finding ID</th><th>Risk</th><th>Status</th><th>Owner</th><th>Due</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:.72rem;white-space:nowrap\">RCR-8067-001</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span style=\"font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;padding:.15rem .4rem;background:#fef3c7;color:#92400e;border:1px solid #fcd34d\">MEDIUM</span></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span style=\"font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;padding:.15rem .4rem;background:#dcfce7;color:#15803d;border:1px solid #86efac\">REMEDIATED</span></td><td style=\"font-size:.75rem\">Director of Financial Reporting</td><td style=\"font-size:.72rem;white-space:nowrap\">2011-05-28</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem;max-width:240px\">Pay grade overlap exceeding policy threshold between consecutive salary bands</td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:.72rem;white-space:nowrap\">RCR-9678-002</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span style=\"font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;padding:.15rem .4rem;background:#f1f5f9;color:#475569;border:1px solid #cbd5e1\">INFO</span></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span style=\"font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;padding:.15rem .4rem;background:#eff6ff;color:#1d4ed8;border:1px solid #93c5fd\">MONITORING</span></td><td style=\"font-size:.75rem\">Senior Analyst, ESG &amp; Sustainability</td><td style=\"font-size:.72rem;white-space:nowrap\">2011-02-28</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem;max-width:240px\">Pay grade overlap exceeding policy threshold between consecutive salary bands</td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:.72rem;white-space:nowrap\">RCR-8279-003</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span style=\"font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;padding:.15rem .4rem;background:#f1f5f9;color:#475569;border:1px solid #cbd5e1\">INFO</span></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span style=\"font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;padding:.15rem .4rem;background:#eff6ff;color:#1d4ed8;border:1px solid #93c5fd\">MONITORING</span></td><td style=\"font-size:.75rem\">Chief Sustainability Officer</td><td style=\"font-size:.72rem;white-space:nowrap\">2011-03-28</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem;max-width:240px\">EU Whistleblower Protection Directive transposition into local country policies is incomplete for 11 EU member states</td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:.72rem;white-space:nowrap\">RCR-8793-004</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span style=\"font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;padding:.15rem .4rem;background:#fef9c3;color:#854d0e;border:1px solid #fde047\">LOW</span></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span style=\"font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;padding:.15rem .4rem;background:#f1f5f9;color:#475569;border:1px solid #cbd5e1\">DEFERRED</span></td><td style=\"font-size:.75rem\">Vice President of External Affairs</td><td style=\"font-size:.72rem;white-space:nowrap\">2011-05-28</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem;max-width:240px\">System access for 335 terminated employees not revoked within the 24-hour SLA defined by IT security policy</td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:.72rem;white-space:nowrap\">RCR-9672-005</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span style=\"font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;padding:.15rem .4rem;background:#fef3c7;color:#92400e;border:1px solid #fcd34d\">MEDIUM</span></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span style=\"font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;padding:.15rem .4rem;background:#dcfce7;color:#15803d;border:1px solid #86efac\">REMEDIATED</span></td><td style=\"font-size:.75rem\">Vice President of Policy</td><td style=\"font-size:.72rem;white-space:nowrap\">2011-02-28</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem;max-width:240px\">Proxy statement CD&amp;A omits required discussion of UK Bribery Act 2010 (corporate failure to prevent bribery offense); Vietnam Era Veterans&#x27; Readjustment Assistance Act (VEVRAA) performance metrics</td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:.72rem;white-space:nowrap\">RCR-2427-006</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span style=\"font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;padding:.15rem .4rem;background:#fef3c7;color:#92400e;border:1px solid #fcd34d\">MEDIUM</span></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span style=\"font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;padding:.15rem .4rem;background:#fee2e2;color:#991b1b;border:1px solid #fca5a5\">OPEN</span></td><td style=\"font-size:.75rem\">Director of Enterprise Risk</td><td style=\"font-size:.72rem;white-space:nowrap\">2011-02-28</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem;max-width:240px\">Pay grade overlap exceeding policy threshold between consecutive salary bands</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class=\"mb-4\"><h5 style=\"font-weight:800;color:var(--navy);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;font-size:.8rem;margin-bottom:1rem;padding-bottom:.5rem;border-bottom:2px solid var(--gold)\">4. Detailed Findings</h5><div style=\"background:white;border:1px solid var(--border);margin-bottom:1rem;padding:1rem 1.2rem\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.5rem;margin-bottom:.55rem\"><code style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666\">RCR-8067-001</code><span style=\"font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;padding:.15rem .4rem;background:#fef3c7;color:#92400e;border:1px solid #fcd34d\">MEDIUM</span><span style=\"font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;padding:.15rem .4rem;background:#dcfce7;color:#15803d;border:1px solid #86efac\">REMEDIATED</span></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:.5rem\"><div style=\"font-size:.65rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.07em;color:#888;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Observation</div><p style=\"font-size:.85rem;line-height:1.65;color:#333;margin-bottom:0\">Pay grade overlap exceeding policy threshold between consecutive salary bands</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:.5rem;padding-top:.5rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border)\"><div style=\"font-size:.65rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.07em;color:#888;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Corrective Action Required</div><p style=\"font-size:.85rem;line-height:1.65;color:#333;margin-bottom:0\">The designated management official at each of the 11 establishments shall personally certify the OSHA 300A summary by the February 1st deadline annually.</p></div><div style=\"padding-top:.5rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border)\"><div style=\"font-size:.65rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.07em;color:#888;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Management Response</div><p style=\"font-size:.85rem;line-height:1.65;color:#333;margin-bottom:.4rem\">We concur. A project charter has been approved to address this finding. The project manager has been assigned, and a kickoff meeting is scheduled for {date}.</p><div style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666\">Owner: <strong>Director of Financial Reporting</strong> &bull; Due: <strong>2011-05-28</strong></div></div></div><div style=\"background:white;border:1px solid var(--border);margin-bottom:1rem;padding:1rem 1.2rem\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.5rem;margin-bottom:.55rem\"><code style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666\">RCR-9678-002</code><span style=\"font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;padding:.15rem .4rem;background:#f1f5f9;color:#475569;border:1px solid #cbd5e1\">INFORMATIONAL</span></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:.5rem\"><div style=\"font-size:.65rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.07em;color:#888;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Observation</div><p style=\"font-size:.85rem;line-height:1.65;color:#333;margin-bottom:0\">Pay grade overlap exceeding policy threshold between consecutive salary bands</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:.5rem;padding-top:.5rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border)\"><div style=\"font-size:.65rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.07em;color:#888;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Corrective Action Required</div><p style=\"font-size:.85rem;line-height:1.65;color:#333;margin-bottom:0\">The annual open enrollment communications package will be updated to include the most current HIPAA privacy notice as a mandatory acknowledgment item for all enrolling employees.</p></div><div style=\"padding-top:.5rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border)\"><div style=\"font-size:.65rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.07em;color:#888;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Management Response</div><p style=\"font-size:.85rem;line-height:1.65;color:#333;margin-bottom:.4rem\">While we accept the factual basis of the finding, we have performed a risk assessment and formally accepted the residual risk. This decision has been documented and approved by the Chief Risk Officer. No further corrective action is planned at this time.</p><div style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666\">Owner: <strong>Senior Analyst, ESG &amp; Sustainability</strong> &bull; Due: <strong>2011-02-28</strong></div></div></div><div style=\"background:white;border:1px solid var(--border);margin-bottom:1rem;padding:1rem 1.2rem\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.5rem;margin-bottom:.55rem\"><code style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666\">RCR-8279-003</code><span style=\"font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;padding:.15rem .4rem;background:#f1f5f9;color:#475569;border:1px solid #cbd5e1\">INFORMATIONAL</span></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:.5rem\"><div style=\"font-size:.65rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.07em;color:#888;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Observation</div><p style=\"font-size:.85rem;line-height:1.65;color:#333;margin-bottom:0\">EU Whistleblower Protection Directive transposition into local country policies is incomplete for 11 EU member states</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:.5rem;padding-top:.5rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border)\"><div style=\"font-size:.65rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.07em;color:#888;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Corrective Action Required</div><p style=\"font-size:.85rem;line-height:1.65;color:#333;margin-bottom:0\">The 401(k) plan fiduciary committee shall formalize its vendor review process, including the issuance of RFPs and documentation of the selection rationale for all plan service providers.</p></div><div style=\"padding-top:.5rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border)\"><div style=\"font-size:.65rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.07em;color:#888;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Management Response</div><p style=\"font-size:.85rem;line-height:1.65;color:#333;margin-bottom:.4rem\">The finding is acknowledged. A cross-functional task force has been assembled to address the root cause. An initial project plan and timeline will be submitted to ACPWB within 15 days.</p><div style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666\">Owner: <strong>Chief Sustainability Officer</strong> &bull; Due: <strong>2011-03-28</strong></div></div></div><div style=\"background:white;border:1px solid var(--border);margin-bottom:1rem;padding:1rem 1.2rem\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.5rem;margin-bottom:.55rem\"><code style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666\">RCR-8793-004</code><span style=\"font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;padding:.15rem .4rem;background:#fef9c3;color:#854d0e;border:1px solid #fde047\">LOW</span></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:.5rem\"><div style=\"font-size:.65rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.07em;color:#888;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Observation</div><p style=\"font-size:.85rem;line-height:1.65;color:#333;margin-bottom:0\">System access for 335 terminated employees not revoked within the 24-hour SLA defined by IT security policy</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:.5rem;padding-top:.5rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border)\"><div style=\"font-size:.65rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.07em;color:#888;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Corrective Action Required</div><p style=\"font-size:.85rem;line-height:1.65;color:#333;margin-bottom:0\">The proxy drafting process will include a &quot;Disclosure Checklist&quot; to ensure all required tables and narrative discussions under SEC Regulation S-K Item 402 are included and accurate.</p></div><div style=\"padding-top:.5rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border)\"><div style=\"font-size:.65rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.07em;color:#888;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Management Response</div><p style=\"font-size:.85rem;line-height:1.65;color:#333;margin-bottom:.4rem\">We are awaiting final evidence of remediation from the third-party vendor responsible for this process. We have received their commitment to provide the necessary documentation by 2011-01-05 and will forward it to ACPWB upon receipt.</p><div style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666\">Owner: <strong>Vice President of External Affairs</strong> &bull; Due: <strong>2011-05-28</strong></div></div></div><div style=\"background:white;border:1px solid var(--border);margin-bottom:1rem;padding:1rem 1.2rem\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.5rem;margin-bottom:.55rem\"><code style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666\">RCR-9672-005</code><span style=\"font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;padding:.15rem .4rem;background:#fef3c7;color:#92400e;border:1px solid #fcd34d\">MEDIUM</span><span style=\"font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;padding:.15rem .4rem;background:#dcfce7;color:#15803d;border:1px solid #86efac\">REMEDIATED</span></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:.5rem\"><div style=\"font-size:.65rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.07em;color:#888;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Observation</div><p style=\"font-size:.85rem;line-height:1.65;color:#333;margin-bottom:0\">Proxy statement CD&amp;A omits required discussion of UK Bribery Act 2010 (corporate failure to prevent bribery offense); Vietnam Era Veterans&#x27; Readjustment Assistance Act (VEVRAA) performance metrics</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:.5rem;padding-top:.5rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border)\"><div style=\"font-size:.65rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.07em;color:#888;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Corrective Action Required</div><p style=\"font-size:.85rem;line-height:1.65;color:#333;margin-bottom:0\">The HRIS system logic for FMLA eligibility shall be updated to correctly account for hours worked in the 12 months preceding the leave request, including for re-hired employees.</p></div><div style=\"padding-top:.5rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border)\"><div style=\"font-size:.65rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.07em;color:#888;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Management Response</div><p style=\"font-size:.85rem;line-height:1.65;color:#333;margin-bottom:.4rem\">We concur with the finding but disagree with the &quot;HIGH&quot; risk rating. Based on our internal analysis, the likelihood of occurrence is low, and the potential impact is minimal. We have re-rated this finding as &quot;LOW&quot; in our internal GRC system and will remediate it as resources permit.</p><div style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666\">Owner: <strong>Vice President of Policy</strong> &bull; Due: <strong>2011-02-28</strong></div></div></div><div style=\"background:white;border:1px solid var(--border);margin-bottom:1rem;padding:1rem 1.2rem\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.5rem;margin-bottom:.55rem\"><code style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666\">RCR-2427-006</code><span style=\"font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;padding:.15rem .4rem;background:#fef3c7;color:#92400e;border:1px solid #fcd34d\">MEDIUM</span></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:.5rem\"><div style=\"font-size:.65rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.07em;color:#888;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Observation</div><p style=\"font-size:.85rem;line-height:1.65;color:#333;margin-bottom:0\">Pay grade overlap exceeding policy threshold between consecutive salary bands</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:.5rem;padding-top:.5rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border)\"><div style=\"font-size:.65rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.07em;color:#888;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Corrective Action Required</div><p style=\"font-size:.85rem;line-height:1.65;color:#333;margin-bottom:0\">The company website and all subsidiary career sites will be updated to include a compliant &quot;Your Privacy Choices&quot; link, and a dedicated internal team will be trained to handle data subject requests.</p></div><div style=\"padding-top:.5rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border)\"><div style=\"font-size:.65rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.07em;color:#888;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Management Response</div><p style=\"font-size:.85rem;line-height:1.65;color:#333;margin-bottom:.4rem\">Management acknowledges the finding and has initiated a preliminary review. The designated owner will oversee remediation. Kittatinny Advisory requests a 30-day extension to the original due date to allow for thorough analysis across all affected locations.</p><div style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666\">Owner: <strong>Director of Enterprise Risk</strong> &bull; Due: <strong>2011-02-28</strong></div></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-top:1.5rem;padding-top:1.25rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border);display:flex;justify-content:space-between\"><a href=\"/archive/2011/01/04/circular-economy-roadmap-9263/\" style=\"font-size:.85rem;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none\">&larr; Previous</a><a href=\"/archive/2011/01/05/board-minutes-draft-0007/defense-electronics-compensation-4683/\" style=\"font-size:.85rem;color:var(--navy);font-weight:600;text-decoration:none\">Next &rarr;</a></div></div><div class=\"col-lg-4 d-none d-lg-block\"><div style=\"position:sticky;top:2rem\"><div class=\"acpwb-card mb-3\"><div style=\"font-size:.65rem;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;colo